# Files excluded from the chart itself.
#
# Do NOT list charts/*.tgz here. That belongs in .gitignore — keeping the
# tarballs out of git is right, but hiding them from Helm makes it download the
# dependencies and then fail with "found in Chart.yaml, but missing in charts/
# directory", which reads like a download failure and is not one.
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
*.tmp
*.orig
